<section class="band alt" id="start">
  <div class="wrap sec">
    <span class="num">07</span>
    <div class="sec-body">
      <h2>两分钟装好</h2>

      <ol class="steps">
        <li>
          <p>装。三种方式任选一种，脚本会探测本机装了哪些 agent，只往存在的宿主里放。</p>
          <p class="way">有 Node</p>
          <div class="cmd sm">
            <code id="c1">npx github:tsonglew/adhd-md</code>
            <button type="button" class="copy" data-copy="#c1" aria-label="复制">复制</button>
          </div>
          <p class="way">没 Node</p>
          <div class="cmd sm">
            <code id="c1b">curl -fsSL https://tsonglew.github.io/adhd-md/install.sh | bash</code>
            <button type="button" class="copy" data-copy="#c1b" aria-label="复制">复制</button>
          </div>
          <p class="way">想改源码</p>
          <div class="cmd sm">
            <code id="c1c">git clone https://github.com/tsonglew/adhd-md &amp;&amp; cd adhd-md
bash scripts/install.sh</code>
            <button type="button" class="copy" data-copy="#c1c" aria-label="复制">复制</button>
          </div>
          <p class="note-sm">克隆装的是软链，<code>git pull</code> 即更新。npx 与 curl 装的是复制，重跑一次即更新。</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <p>先审一篇看看分数和问题清单。</p>
          <div class="cmd sm">
            <code id="c2">npx github:tsonglew/adhd-md audit 你的文档.md</code>
            <button type="button" class="copy" data-copy="#c2" aria-label="复制">复制</button>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <p>然后在任意 agent 里直接说人话。</p>
          <blockquote>把 README.md 改成 ADHD 友好的，只改格式</blockquote>
        </li>
      </ol>

      <div class="grid-2 tail">
        <div>
          <h3>接 CI</h3>
          <div class="cmd sm">
            <code id="c3">adhd_md.py fmt --check docs/*.md
adhd_md.py audit --min-score 70 docs/*.md</code>
            <button type="button" class="copy" data-copy="#c3" aria-label="复制">复制</button>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3>没有命令执行能力的环境</h3>
          <p>
            网页版 LLM 直接粘贴自包含单文件
            <a href="https://github.com/tsonglew/adhd-md/blob/main/dist/adhd-md.standalone.md">adhd-md.standalone.md</a>
            ，30 KB，规则全带。降级后没有机器校验，报告里必须写明。
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
